{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13211580","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13211580","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"narration:0:1321158001:0":{"text":"몰래 축복 포션을 사용하자 성스럽고 따스한 기운이 나타샤와 아르힙을 감싸기 시작했다...","source_cn":"你悄悄扔出祝福药水，一股神圣而温暖的气息随之包裹住了娜...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01E63EB4828C93E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1321158002:1":{"text":"어라...?!","source_cn":"咦……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D4147835917B2AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321158003:1":{"text":"왜 그래, 나타샤?","source_cn":"怎么了，娜塔莎？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4BE55EE9339B34F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321158004:1":{"text":"아르힙, 뭔가 따뜻한 느낌이 들지 않아? 마치... 수도사님이 세례를 주셨을 때랑 비슷해. 하지만 훨씬 더 순수하고 강렬한 기운이야!","source_cn":"阿尔希普，你有没有感受到一种很温暖的感觉？就像是……像...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A07AA1A56514E37","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321158005:1":{"text":"나도 그래... 그리고 굉장히 신성해.","source_cn":"确实有这种感觉……而且很神圣。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEBBAC3EC92A8978","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321158006:1":{"text":"신성...?!\n...알겠다! 이건 듀라 여신님의 축복이야!","source_cn":"神圣……？！\\n——我知道了！这是艾雅女神的祝福！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42152E041D9A400E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1321158007:1":{"text":"이제 알겠어... 전설의 가장 아름다운 풍경은 특정한 장소가 아니라, 사랑하는 사람과 함께 겪는 가장 아름답고 소중한 순간이었던 거야...","source_cn":"原来是这样……传说中的最美风景，并不是哪一个确切的地方...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF325A0399D4445B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1321158008:1":{"text":"아르힙! 어서 나와 함께 여신님께 기도하자!","source_cn":"快！阿尔希普，快和我一起，向女神祈祷！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF01A569E2F88408","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1321158009:1":{"text":"네가 바라는 대로 할게, 사랑하는 나타샤.","source_cn":"都听你的，亲爱的娜塔莎。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x420D6EDE58768D0E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"블랙 스크린 자막","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:娜塔莎":{"text":"나타샤","source":"娜塔莎","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿尔希普":{"text":"아르힙","source":"阿尔希普","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":10,"localized_text_count":9,"speaker_count":3}}